; Minimal probe for arrayJoin (contract entry 40): the corpus previously
; reached `join` only inside a multi-feature fixture, so a failure there could
; not be attributed to this node. One node, five receiver shapes: a named
; array, a literal, an empty separator, a single element, and the empty
; receiver. The empty case is an "empty receiver policy" question (empty
; string vs panic), not the grapheme-vs-byte axis the contract's B group is
; about, which is why it is spelled out here rather than left implied.

main|func() -> ():
